<title>UK: Salomon sets 1.0 bln French franc five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets 1.0 bln French franc five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SALOMON INC</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    12.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.452   PAY DATE    12.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.902    SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB	 HOME CTRY  U.S.	SALE LIMITS US/GB/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.55	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
